## Develop

Every quality gate is a git hook, and CI runs the same hooks: lint and
format, strict types, workflow security, and before a push a build plus
screenshots in light and dark on desktop and phone that fail on a broken chart,
a console error or a sideways scroll. [DEVELOPMENT.md](DEVELOPMENT.md) has
the details.

Built with [atelier](https://github.com/EssenceSentry/atelier).
